WEBVTT

cue-1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
A legal partition is a starting point. Refinement decides which move to trust.
合法分区只是起点，优化算法决定该相信哪一种移动。

cue-2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:28.000
ABC versus DEF is balanced, but the cut costs ten.
ABC 对 DEF 虽然尺寸平衡，但割边代价为 10。

cue-3
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Pair gain combines both local gains, then removes the edge counted twice.
配对收益合并两个局部收益，再扣掉被重复计算的直连边。

cue-4
00:00:46.000 --> 00:01:05.000
D(C)=4, D(F)=−1, so the pair gain is +3 and the cut becomes seven.
D(C)=4，D(F)=−1，配对收益为 +3，割边代价降到 7。

cue-5
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:24.500
KL records every cumulative gain, then restores the best prefix of the pass.
KL 记录每一步的累计收益，最后回滚到该轮的最佳前缀。

cue-6
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:41.500
The path reaches +9 before falling. The best prefix is not the final state.
累计收益一度达到 +9 后回落，最佳状态并不在整轮末尾。

cue-7
00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:56.500
D has gain +5. Moving it to ABC produces a 4|2 split, allowed by the gap limit.
D 的收益为 +5；在尺寸差上限为 2 时，移到 ABC 后可形成 4|2 的合法分区。

cue-8
00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:14.000
FM reduces the cut to five, but changes the side sizes from 3|3 to 4|2.
FM 把割边代价降到 5，但侧尺寸也从 3|3 变成 4|2。

cue-9
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:34.000
KL coordinates swaps. FM scales single moves. Neither guarantees a global optimum.
KL 协调交换，FM 扩展单点移动；两者都只保证局部结果。

cue-10
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:51.000
Balance, locked cells, connectivity, and the stop rule define the feasible search.
平衡、锁定单元、连通性和停止条件共同定义了可行搜索。

cue-11
00:02:51.000 --> 00:03:07.000
A trustworthy result includes the assignment, cut, balance, gains, and stop point.
可信结果应包含最终分区、割边代价、平衡、收益和停止位置。

cue-12
00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:25.500
KL coordinates pairs. FM scales single moves. Both need feasible, verified results.
KL 协调交换，FM 扩展单点移动；两者都需要可行且经过验证的结果。
